<title>SWEDEN: P&amp;U to invest 50 mln SKR in eye research.</title>
<headline>P&amp;U to invest 50 mln SKR in eye research.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S./Swedish drugs company Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn (P&amp;U) said on Wednesday it would invest 50 million crowns over the next five years in research into eye diseases.</p>
<p>The programme will be carried out with researchers at Uppsala University, north of Stockholm, and financed by the company.</p>
<p>P&amp;U said in a statement that it would invest 10 million crowns annually in the programme for the next five years.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
